%% names.sty -- the canonical vocabulary of every deck repository (talks and courses)
%% Andrea Omicini <mailto:andrea.omicini@unibo.it>
%%
%% Never loaded by a deck. Each repository's own sty/names.sty is a FILE (never a link) holding the
%% lines of this file it uses, copied as they are, plus what is its own (marked `% local`).
%% Late binding (Andrea, 2026-11-03): a change here is not propagated. A name is aligned in a repository
%% only when the decks using it are rebuilt anyway, never to redo them all; a new name is copied from here.
%% /course-check and /deck-check list, as `later`, a name defined otherwise than here and a name neither
%% here nor marked local (promote it here, or mark it local).
%% One line per name. `% decision:` marks a name whose forms in use print differently: the line is the
%% majority form until Andrea chooses; the other forms are listed.
%%
\ProvidesPackage{names}[2026/11/03 The canonical vocabulary -- beamer-AMSUniBo/check]

